{"pageProps":{"data":{"news_id":"682","news_catgory":"0","hot_news":"0","news_push":"","news_on_top":"1","news_title":"非洲象啃樹 意外對抗氣候變遷原因是…","news_summary":"","image_path":"","news_content":"<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; float: none; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; display: inline !important;\\\">2019-07-16 16:43</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" src=\\\"http://www.stspcsr.com.tw/user_files/news_files/%E9%9D%9E%E6%B4%B2%E8%B1%A1.jpg\\\" style=\\\"border: 0px; border-image: none; width: 800px; height: 533px; vertical-align: middle; box-sizing: border-box;\\\" /></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">生活於西非和剛果盆地的非洲森林象 （<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">Loxodonta cyclotis</span>）每天吃掉重<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">450</span>斤的植披，看似摧毀生態，不過，有科學期刊指出，非洲象吃掉植披反而使雨林植物質量增加，有助改善氣候變遷問題。（路透）</span></p>\n\n<hr initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: content-box; height: 1px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; border: 0px; background-image: -webkit-linear-gradient(left, transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), transparent); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\" />\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">〔即時新聞／綜合報導〕生活於西非和剛果盆地的非洲森林象（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">Loxodonta cyclotis</span>）每天吃掉<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">450</span>公斤的植物，看似摧毀生態，不過，科學期刊指出，非洲象吃掉植披反讓雨林增加植物質量，吸收更多二氧化碳，有助改善氣候變遷問題。</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">據《自然地球科學》研究指出，法國與義大利的研究團隊以數學模型，預測非洲象的行為如何影響棲息地，發現非洲象喜歡咀嚼直徑小於<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">30</span>厘米的樹木和植物，結果顯示，平均地面上的樹木直徑與植披的總體質量反倒增加，反而能吸收環境中更多的碳，換言之非洲象群族間接與對抗氣候變化有關。</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">研究團隊的模型數字也與現實情況相符，例如，剛果盆地中樹木木材密度在有非洲象棲息的地區，比沒有非洲象的地區，高出每立方米<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">75</span>公克；即使每平方公里只有<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">1</span>頭非洲象，團隊指出，雨林植披也增加到每公頃<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">60</span>噸，使非洲<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">220</span>萬平方公里的森林中吸收超過<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">100</span>億噸的二氧化碳。</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">目前僅約剩有<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">10</span>萬隻非洲象，研究指如果大象滅絕，中非雨林儲存的碳量將會下跌<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">7</span>％；大象影響森林生態系統的結果，也可以解釋為何不同地區的熱帶雨林植披多樣性會出現明顯區別，例如，秘魯的亞馬遜雨林並無大象，與剛果的熱帶雨林氣候和土壤條件相似，但剛果就出現樹木較小、且樹葉較茂密的生態。</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">資料來源<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">: https://news.ltn.com.tw/news/world/breakingnews/2854307</span></span></p>\n\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"0","create_date":"2019-07-22","clk_count":"228"}},"__N_SSG":true}